   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORPORACION CARIBE AFIRMATIVO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project Travelling &#x201c;Casa Caribe&quot; in Colombia, implemented by Caribe Afirmativo, aims to contribute to a safer space for migrant LGBTI people, refugees, and host communities.  The objectives of the grant are to generate safe and friendly spaces for 160 Colombian and Venezuelan members of the LGBTQ+ community.  The key activities include creating an itinerant office which will visit each city to provide psychosocial and legal services.</narrative>
  </description>
